    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hello,\r\n\r\nI'm trying to define \"number\" textobject. Basically, I'm combining these two examples from the docs:\r\n\r\n- \"Number\": `{ '%f[%d]%d+' }` \r\n- \"Imitate word ignoring digits and punctuation (supports only Latin alphabet)\": `{ '()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()' }`\r\n\r\nJust replacing `%w` with `%d` I arrived at\r\n\r\n```lua\r\ncustom_textobjects = {\r\n  U = { \"()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()\" },\r\n  S = { \"()()%f[%d]%d+()[ \\t]*()\" }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nTesting on `1234    `, `vaU` correctly selects the whole line, whereas `vaS` only selects the first space. Where is the mistake please?\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hello,</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm trying to define \"number\" textobject. Basically, I'm combining these two examples from the docs:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\"Number\": <code class=\"notranslate\">{ '%f[%d]%d+' }</code></li>\n<li>\"Imitate word ignoring digits and punctuation (supports only Latin alphabet)\": <code class=\"notranslate\">{ '()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()' }</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Just replacing <code class=\"notranslate\">%w</code> with <code class=\"notranslate\">%d</code> I arrived at</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"custom_textobjects = {\n  U = { &quot;()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()&quot; },\n  S = { &quot;()()%f[%d]%d+()[ \\t]*()&quot; }\n}\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">custom_textobjects</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> {\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">U</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>()()%f[%w]%w+()[ <span class=\"pl-cce\">\\t</span>]*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>},\n  <span class=\"pl-smi\">S</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> { <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>()()%f[%d]%d+()[ <span class=\"pl-cce\">\\t</span>]*()<span class=\"pl-pds\">\" </span></span>}\n}</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Testing on <code class=\"notranslate\">1234    </code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">vaU</code> correctly selects the whole line, whereas <code class=\"notranslate\">vaS</code> only selects the first space. Where is the mistake please?</p>",
    "bodyText": "Hello,\nI'm trying to define \"number\" textobject. Basically, I'm combining these two examples from the docs:\n\n\"Number\": { '%f[%d]%d+' }\n\"Imitate word ignoring digits and punctuation (supports only Latin alphabet)\": { '()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()' }\n\nJust replacing %w with %d I arrived at\ncustom_textobjects = {\n  U = { \"()()%f[%w]%w+()[ \\t]*()\" },\n  S = { \"()()%f[%d]%d+()[ \\t]*()\" }\n}\nTesting on 1234    , vaU correctly selects the whole line, whereas vaS only selects the first space. Where is the mistake please?",
